From 0b5269ce22091cb2ea8f7ef10864720500dc569c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:28:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix free-model catalog freshness after on-disk rewrites

Invalidate the module cache when config/openrouter.free-models.json mtime
changes, and drop held OpenRouter consultations when that file is rewritten
so a stale snapshot can refresh without waiting for the 24h hold.
---
